<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Feb 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Wheat Board international card prices for wheat exports for January 31.</p>
<p>In U.S. dollars per tonne, FOB eastern states.</p>
<p>		ASW	  AH     PH 13 PCT PH 14 PCT</p>
<p>    Feb    198.00    202.50    205.50    216.50</p>
<p>    Mar    198.00    202.50    205.50    216.50</p>
<p>    Apr    197.00    201.50    204.50    216.50</p>
<p>    May    197.00    201.50    204.50    216.50</p>
<p>    Jun    197.00    201.50    204.50    216.50</p>
<p>    Jul    195.50    200.00    203.00    215.00</p>
<p>Note: ASW = Australian Standard White; AH = Australian Hard; PH = Australian Prime Hard; percentages = protein content.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
